      "content": "Please be advised that this major is currently being discontinued and may not be available upon transfer. Please visit academicaffairs.sonoma.edu/academic-programs for the most recent information.",
      "contentHtml": "<p><strong style=\"color: rgb(169, 62, 58); font-size: 16px;\">Please be advised that this major is currently being discontinued and may not be available upon transfer. Please visit</strong><strong style=\"font-size: 16px;\"> </strong><a href=\"http://academicaffairs.sonoma.edu/academic-programs\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><strong>academicaffairs.sonoma.edu/academic-programs</strong></a><strong style=\"font-size: 16px;\"> </strong><strong style=\"color: rgb(169, 62, 58); font-size: 16px;\">for the most recent information.</strong></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p>"
